      "post_subject": "TMG",
      "content_md": "I noticed that the liquid form of TMG (1,1,3,3-Tetramethylguanidine) is quite uncommon these days, while the solid form seems to be more easily obtainable. I was wondering if anyone has tried using the solid form with Jeff Blyth's MBDCG system. I would think they would be the same, although Jeff's formula would need some adjusting, since it calls for the liquid version.",
      "signature": "",
      "attachments": [],
      "quotes": [],
      "is_first_post": true,
      "url": "https://holographyforum.org/forum/viewtopic.php?p=4110#p4110"
    },
    {
      "post_id": 4112,
