      "post_date": "Thu Feb 02, 2012 2:27 pm",
      "post_datetime": "2012-02-02T19:27:00+00:00",
      "post_subject": "TMG",
      "content_md": "Hello Joe,\n\nI had tried guanidine-carbonate with MBDCG. The results were similar as with TMG but the sensitivity of the plates was noticeably lower, maybe 3x less. It is easier to handle, no stinking corrosive fumes. You can replace the TMG about 1:1 with the carbonate.",
      "signature": "",
      "attachments": [],
      "quotes": [],
      "is_first_post": false,
      "url": "https://holographyforum.org/forum/viewtopic.php?p=4112#p4112"
